2026-10-12      The libeflvala contributors

        * Collections: the Gee collections from gee-0.8 are now used
          throughout the Vala sources (Gee.HashMap for the
          EflVala.ViewState transition map, Gee.ArrayList in the examples
          and tests). libgee (gee-0.8) is a new build/runtime dependency;
          it is wired into the Meson build, the eflvala-1.0 pkg-config
          file and the eflvala-1.0.deps VAPI dependency list.

        * Build system consolidation: Meson is now the canonical (and only)
          build system. The Autotools infrastructure (configure.ac,
          Makefile.am, autogen.sh, Makefile.decl and the generated
          eflvala-1.0.pc template) has been removed. Use `meson setup build`,
          `meson compile -C build`, `meson test -C build` and
          `meson install -C build`. See INSTALL for details.

See git log for small-scale changes.
